{"seq":2,"slug":"contract-law","title":"合同法基础","stage":"DONE","category":"law-legal","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law","rating":{"composite":3.62,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.25,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 合同法基础 简介\n\n合同是现代商业社会最基本的法律工具，也是程序员在职业生涯中接触最频繁的法律文件之一。从入职签订的劳动合同，到项目中涉及的技术服务协议、软件许可协议，再到创业时的投资协议和合伙协议，合同无处不在。理解合同法的基本原理，能帮助你更好地保护自身权益、识别潜在风险。\n\n本知识库面向程序员、技术管理者和创业者，以实用为导向，系统讲解合同法的核心知识。你无需法律专业背景，但需要对\"权利与义务\"这一基本概念有朴素的认知。\n\n全书共分为四章，从合同的诞生到履行，从传统合同类型到数字时代的新形态，构成完整的知识链条。\n\n第一章**合同的成立**讲解合同从无到有的过程，包括要约与承诺的规则、合同成立的必备要件、合同的分类方式以及缔约过程中的法律责任。理解合同如何成立，是判断合同是否有效的第一步。\n\n第二章**合同的履行**聚焦于合同成立之后的核心问题，包括如何正确履行合同义务、违约时应承担什么责任、合同在什么条件下可以变更或解除，以及不可抗力等特殊情形的处理规则。\n\n第三章**典型合同**介绍日常工作中最常见的合同类型，涵盖买卖合同、服务合同与承揽合同、租赁合同以及技术合同与许可协议。每种合同都有其特殊规则，了解这些差异能帮助你在具体场景中做出正确判断。\n\n第四章**数字时代的合同**专门探讨互联网和软件行业中的合同新形态，包括电子合同与电子签名的法律效力、点击协议与格式条款的规制、SaaS 与云服务协议的关键条款，以及开源许可证的法律本质。这一章是技术人员最应重点关注的内容。\n\n建议先顺序学习前两章建立合同法的通用基础，然后根据自身需求有选择地深入第三章和第四章的具体主题。如果你是创业者或技术管理者，第四章的内容尤为重要。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"contract-formation","title":"合同的成立","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law/contract-formation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"offer-and-acceptance","title":"要约与承诺","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law/contract-formation/offer-and-acceptance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"contract-elements","title":"合同成立要件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law/contract-formation/contract-elements"},{"seq":3,"slug":"contract-types","title":"合同的分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law/contract-formation/contract-types"},{"seq":4,"slug":"precontractual-liability","title":"缔约过失责任","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law/contract-formation/precontractual-liability"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"contract-performance","title":"合同的履行","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law/contract-performance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"performance-principles","title":"履行原则与规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law/contract-performance/performance-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"breach-of-contract","title":"违约责任","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law/contract-performance/breach-of-contract"},{"seq":3,"slug":"contract-modification","title":"合同变更与解除","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law/contract-performance/contract-modification"},{"seq":4,"slug":"force-majeure","title":"不可抗力与情势变更","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law/contract-performance/force-majeure"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"special-contracts","title":"典型合同","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law/special-contracts","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sales-contract","title":"买卖合同","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law/special-contracts/sales-contract"},{"seq":2,"slug":"service-contract","title":"服务合同与承揽合同","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law/special-contracts/service-contract"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lease-contract","title":"租赁合同","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law/special-contracts/lease-contract"},{"seq":4,"slug":"tech-contracts","title":"技术合同与许可协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law/special-contracts/tech-contracts"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"digital-contracts","title":"数字时代的合同","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law/digital-contracts","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"electronic-contracts","title":"电子合同与电子签名","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law/digital-contracts/electronic-contracts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"click-wrap-agreements","title":"点击协议与格式条款","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law/digital-contracts/click-wrap-agreements"},{"seq":3,"slug":"saas-agreements","title":"SaaS 与云服务协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law/digital-contracts/saas-agreements"},{"seq":4,"slug":"open-source-licenses","title":"开源许可证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/contract-law/digital-contracts/open-source-licenses"}]}]}